From 188bd54341dd352b09bd0c74a0e3b64999ac40a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MasherDon <62326358+MasherDon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:22:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 89/92] moe-stream : SiegeLadder G40c / G40d measurement knobs,
 G40 quieter - LLAMA_MOE_STREAM_G40_TIER=1 (G40c): a G40 staging takes its
 victim only among slots whose expert the host tier holds whole
 (pick_victim_tier_locked; changes nothing in practice - the residents are
 tier-backed already, runs.md 4.226); LLAMA_MOE_STREAM_G40_SRC=1 (G40d): stage
 only experts the host tier holds whole - no staging from the drive (G40's
 extra drops vanish, but so does half its gain, 4.227). G40 stays off by
 default (k 0) with h 0.18 as the default threshold when enabled (k 2 h 0.18
 measured best: +4.2...+5.2% decode; general-100 +0.0040 - the default is the
 user's decision); the start-up line and the stats line say "G40:" (no longer
 "measurement"), and with no lens (G35 off, or runahead in the exact preset)
 an unasked G40 stays quiet

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
